                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="testimonial-detail">
                    <p class="m-0 text-black text-[15px] text-left lg:text-[18px] leading-[30px] font-medium mb-[5px]">
                      Cherubim IT has provided their services to us for many months now, which is a testament to
